   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«But» with -지만",
     "texto": [
      "To say «but» after something positive or negative, **-지만** is used.",
      "가다 → **가지만**, 먹다 → **먹지만**, 좋다 → **좋지만**, 비싸다 → **비싸지만**.",
      "음식은 **맛있지만** 비싸요 = the food is tasty, but it's expensive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Compared with 하지만",
     "texto": [
      "**하지만** (but) goes at the start of a sentence; **-지만** is attached to the verb, within the same sentence.",
      "You already know **하지만**, and **맵지만** from A1; now it is used in any sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
